<h1>Home</h1>

<p>Welcome to Certified Coffee. We are a small coffee shop in San Luis Obispo serving coffee, espresso drinks, tea, pastries, and breakfast items.</p>

<p>Stop by to grab a coffee before starting your day, meet up with someone, or just take a break. We want Certified Coffee to be a place where people can relax and enjoy their drink.</p>

