<h1>About</h1>

<p>Certified Coffee started with the idea of making a coffee shop that feels simple and comfortable. We wanted a place where people could stop in for a quick coffee or stay for a little while.</p>

<p>Our menu has different types of coffee, espresso drinks, tea, pastries, and breakfast food. We keep the menu pretty simple so customers can find something they like without having too many choices.</p>

<p>The coffee shop has a relaxed atmosphere and is meant to be a place where customers can hang out, meet with friends, or get some work done.</p>

